### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@shelflife.com",
  "password": "librarian123"
}

### Add Book
POST http://localhost:5000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "author": "J.R.R. Tolkien",
  "isbn": "9780261103344",
  "genre": "Fantasy",
  "totalCopies": 5,
  "availableCopies": 5
}

### Register Member
POST http://localhost:5000/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "membershipId": "MEM-1001"
}

### Issue Book
POST http://localhost:5000/api/borrow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "bookId": "<book-id>",
  "memberId": "<member-id>"
}

### Return Book
POST http://localhost:5000/api/return/<borrow-id>
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Member History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/members/<member-id>/history
